blic","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T04:45:56Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T04:46:08Z","body":"> Without optimizations, CVTT can take several minutes to compress a texture.\n\nIt's possible I just did not wait long enough, on M4 (26 G RAM) it was done almost instantly, but M1 I have tested it on is base model MacBook Air with only 8 G RAM. Will recheck it later.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3116374294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]